# ci/cd
!.github/
!.github/**/
!.github/**/*.yml
!.github/**/*.md
!.pre-commit-config.yaml
!safety-policy.yml

# static analysis / linting
!pyrightconfig.json

# explitic excludes
**/__pycache__/
